<title>USA: UAL's United to open cargo center at JFK.</title>
<headline>UAL's United to open cargo center at JFK.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Airlines, a unit of UAL Corp, said it broke ground Tuesday on a new cargo transfer center at John F. Kennedy International Airport in New York.</p>
<p>The 80,000-square-foot facility is expected to cost $9.5 million and open in April 1997.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
